# 103 - aegis-home (proposal Plate 01)
# New-tab home: 82dp light clock with tabular figures, date micro
# label, 'hardened - 92,957 hosts blocked' status pill and six
# quick-shield tiles over the monochrome gradient. A View overlay
# behind the dock that becomes visible while the current tab is the
# NTP; URL tiles load in the current tab, settings tile opens the
# Aegis ID page, private tile opens a private tab.

--- /dev/null
+++ b/chrome/android/java/src/org/chromium/chrome/browser/aegis/home/AegisHomeView.java
@@ -0,0 +1,248 @@
